---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Lítika AV | Engenharia Cultural">

<main class="cinema">

<div id="splash">

  <div class="splash-container">

    <div class="orbita"></div>

    <h1>LÍTIKA AV</h1>

    <p>
      engenharia cultural • audiovisual • inteligência vetorialética
    </p>

    <div class="loading">

      <div class="loading-bar"></div>

    </div>

  </div>

</div>

<div class="player-musica">

<iframe
src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/XW5safN9NTY?autoplay=1&controls=1&loop=1&playlist=XW5safN9NTY"
allow="autoplay; encrypted-media"
allowfullscreen>
</iframe>

</div>

<div class="video-bg">

<iframe
src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/VCJXhXuQVUs?autoplay=1&mute=1&controls=0&loop=1&playlist=VCJXhXuQVUs&playsinline=1"
allow="autoplay; fullscreen">
</iframe>

</div>

<div class="overlay"></div>

<section class="hero">

<span class="subtitulo">

COMPANHIA VETORIAL DE ATIVOS CULTURAIS

</span>

<h1>

LÍTIKA AV

</h1>

<p class="manifesto">

Cinema.

Museologia.

Ciência.

Arqueologia.

Fotografia.

Tecnologias Vetorialéticas.

</p>

<div class="botoes">

<a href="/sobre">

Conheça

</a>

<a href="/projetos">

Projetos

</a>

<a href="/contato">

Contato

</a>

</div>

</section>

<section class="ativos">

<h2>

ATIVOS ESTRATÉGICOS

</h2>

<div class="cards">

<a href="/mic" class="card">

<h3>MIC</h3>

<p>

Museu da Ilustração Científica.

</p>

</a>

<a href="/missa" class="card">

<h3>MISSA</h3>

<p>

Rede de Museus da Imagem e do Som.

</p>

</a>

<a href="/pesquisa-vetorialetica" class="card">

<h3>VETORIALÉTICA</h3>

<p>

Pesquisa científica de campo contínuo.

</p>

</a>

<a href="/industria-coerencia" class="card">

<h3>INDÚSTRIA DA COERÊNCIA</h3>

<p>

Tecnologias vetorialéticas.

</p>

</a>

<a href="/resfriamento-urbano" class="card">

<h3>RESFRIAMENTO URBANO</h3>

<p>

Infraestruturas climáticas.

</p>

</a>

<a href="/editoria" class="card">

<h3>EDITORIÁ</h3>

<p>

Publicações científicas.

</p>

</a>

</div>

</section>

<section class="destaque">

<div class="texto">

<h2>

INVESTIMENTO EM ATIVOS CULTURAIS

</h2>

<p>

A Lítika AV reúne um conjunto de projetos voltados à cultura, ciência,
engenharia climática, arqueologia, inteligência artificial vetorialética,
museologia e desenvolvimento tecnológico.

</p>

<p>

O objetivo é estruturar ativos capazes de conectar pesquisa,
economia criativa, patrimônio cultural e inovação de interesse público
e privado.

</p>

</div>

<div class="videos">

<iframe
src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/efKWZiEfFkY?mute=1">
</iframe>

<iframe
src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/k-Mgv2_VqSY?mute=1">
</iframe>

</div>

</section>

<footer class="rodape">

<div class="assinatura">

<span>

LÍTIKA AV LTDA.

</span>

<p>

engenharia cultural • audiovisual • arqueologia • inteligência vetorialética

</p>

</div>

</footer>

</main>

<script>

window.addEventListener("load",()=>{

setTimeout(()=>{

document
.getElementById("splash")
.classList.add("sumir");

},2800);

});

</script>

<style>

html{

scroll-behavior:smooth;

}

body{

margin:0;

background:#000;

color:white;

font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;

}

.cinema{

position:relative;

overflow:hidden;

min-height:100vh;

}

#splash{

position:fixed;

inset:0;

display:flex;

justify-content:center;

align-items:center;

background:black;

z-index:99999;

transition:1.2s;

}

#splash.sumir{

opacity:0;

visibility:hidden;

}

.splash-container{

text-align:center;

position:relative;

}

.splash-container h1{

font-size:4rem;

letter-spacing:12px;

color:white;

margin-bottom:20px;

animation:pulsar 3s infinite;

}

.splash-container p{

letter-spacing:4px;

color:#aaa;

}

.orbita{

position:absolute;

left:50%;

top:50%;

width:280px;

height:280px;

margin-left:-140px;

margin-top:-140px;

border-radius:50%;

border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);

animation:girar 10s linear infinite;

}

.orbita::after{

content:"";

position:absolute;

left:50%;

top:-8px;

margin-left:-8px;

width:16px;

height:16px;

border-radius:50%;

background:#fff;

box-shadow:0 0 25px white;

}

.loading{

width:260px;

height:5px;

margin:35px auto;

background:#222;

overflow:hidden;

}

.loading-bar{

height:100%;

width:0;

background:white;

animation:carregar 2.8s linear forwards;

}

.player-musica{

position:fixed;

top:90px;

left:20px;

width:230px;

height:130px;

z-index:900;

opacity:.85;

}

.player-musica iframe{

width:100%;

height:100%;

border:none;

border-radius:10px;

}

.video-bg{

position:fixed;

inset:0;

z-index:-3;

}

.video-bg iframe{

width:100vw;

height:100vh;

pointer-events:none;

border:none;

}

.overlay{

position:fixed;

inset:0;

background:rgba(0,0,0,.60);

z-index:-2;

}

.hero{

min-height:100vh;

display:flex;

flex-direction:column;

justify-content:center;

align-items:center;

text-align:center;

padding:2rem;

}

.subtitulo{

letter-spacing:5px;

color:#c5a86a;

font-size:.8rem;

text-transform:uppercase;

margin-bottom:20px;

}

.hero h1{

font-size:clamp(3rem,8vw,6rem);

letter-spacing:12px;

margin:0;

}

.manifesto{

max-width:800px;

line-height:2;

color:#d0d0d0;

margin-top:35px;

}
.botoes{

display:flex;

justify-content:center;

align-items:center;

gap:1.4rem;

margin-top:3rem;

flex-wrap:wrap;

}

.botoes a{

text-decoration:none;

padding:1rem 2rem;

border-radius:999px;

border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);

background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);

backdrop-filter:blur(16px);

color:#f5e6c8;

letter-spacing:2px;

transition:.35s;

}

.botoes a:hover{

background:#d7b56d;

color:black;

transform:translateY(-4px);

box-shadow:0 0 35px rgba(215,181,109,.35);

}

.ativos{

width:min(1300px,92%);

margin:6rem auto;

}

.ativos h2{

text-align:center;

font-size:2.2rem;

letter-spacing:6px;

margin-bottom:3rem;

color:#f5e6c8;

}

.cards{

display:grid;

grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));

gap:2rem;

}

.card{

text-decoration:none;

padding:2rem;

border-radius:24px;

background:linear-gradient(145deg,
rgba(255,255,255,.05),
rgba(255,255,255,.02));

backdrop-filter:blur(20px);

border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);

transition:.45s;

}

.card:hover{

transform:translateY(-10px);

border-color:#d7b56d;

box-shadow:

0 15px 45px rgba(0,0,0,.45),

0 0 35px rgba(215,181,109,.18);

}

.card h3{

margin:0 0 1rem;

color:#f5e6c8;

letter-spacing:3px;

font-size:1.2rem;

}

.card p{

margin:0;

line-height:1.8;

color:#bdbdbd;

}

.destaque{

width:min(1300px,92%);

margin:7rem auto;

display:grid;

grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;

gap:3rem;

align-items:center;

}

.texto{

padding:2.5rem;

border-radius:24px;

background:linear-gradient(
145deg,
rgba(255,255,255,.05),
rgba(255,255,255,.02));

border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);

backdrop-filter:blur(18px);

}

.texto h2{

margin-top:0;

font-size:2rem;

letter-spacing:4px;

color:#f5e6c8;

}

.texto p{

line-height:2;

color:#c8c8c8;

margin-bottom:1.5rem;

}

.videos{

display:grid;

gap:1.6rem;

}

.videos iframe{

width:100%;

aspect-ratio:16/9;

border:none;

border-radius:18px;

transition:.4s;

filter:brightness(.78);

}

.videos iframe:hover{

transform:scale(1.03);

filter:brightness(1);

}

.rodape{

margin-top:7rem;

padding:4rem 2rem;

border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);

display:flex;

justify-content:center;

align-items:center;

}

.assinatura{

text-align:center;

}

.assinatura span{

display:block;

font-size:1rem;

letter-spacing:6px;

margin-bottom:1rem;

color:#f5e6c8;

}

.assinatura p{

margin:0;

color:#8f8f8f;

letter-spacing:2px;

line-height:1.8;

}

@keyframes girar{

from{

transform:rotate(0deg);

}

to{

transform:rotate(360deg);

}

}

@keyframes pulsar{

0%{

transform:scale(1);

opacity:.9;

}

50%{

transform:scale(1.05);

opacity:1;

text-shadow:

0 0 30px rgba(255,255,255,.45),

0 0 80px rgba(215,181,109,.20);

}

100%{

transform:scale(1);

opacity:.9;

}

}

@keyframes carregar{

0%{

width:0;

}

100%{

width:100%;

}

}

@media(max-width:980px){

.destaque{

grid-template-columns:1fr;

}

.player-musica{

width:190px;

height:106px;

}

}

@media(max-width:700px){

.hero h1{

letter-spacing:5px;

}

.subtitulo{

letter-spacing:2px;

}

.player-musica{

position:relative;

top:0;

left:0;

margin:1.5rem auto;

display:block;

}

.botoes{

flex-direction:column;

}

.ativos h2{

font-size:1.8rem;

}

}

@media(max-width:500px){

.splash-container h1{

font-size:2.3rem;

letter-spacing:5px;

}

.orbita{

width:180px;

height:180px;

margin-left:-90px;

margin-top:-90px;

}

.loading{

width:180px;

}

.card{

padding:1.5rem;

}

.texto{

padding:1.8rem;

}

}

</style>